Package: GeneratePartitionsCommunities
Type: Package
Title: Apply community detection methods to label co-occurrence graphs  
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Elaine Cecília Gatto  
Maintainer: Prof. Elaine Cecilia Gatto <elainececiliagattto@gmail.com>  
Description: GeneratePartitionsCommunities is an R package designed to apply community detection methods, to label co-occurrence graphs previouly buited using the label space, in multi-label classification problems, and findind hybrid partitions (between global and local approaches)
  It provides tools for constructing and analyzing label co-occurrence networks, facilitating the identification of label clusters to enhance classification models.  
Depends: R (>= 4.0)  
License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0  
Encoding: UTF-8  
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)  
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2  
Imports: progress, dplyr, tidyr, tidyverse, igraph, mldr, utiml, stringr, parallel, doParallel  
